[E0405] Error: cannot move `bag`, which is behind a reference
    ╭─[ err/104_closure_moves/main.wip:16:21 ]
    │
 16 │         val taken = bag        // the closure only borrowed it
    │                     ─┬─
    │                      ╰─── behind a `&` reference
    │
    │ Note: a reference can read a value but cannot take ownership of it
────╯
[E0404] Error: `bag` is given here, and used again
    ╭─[ err/104_closure_moves/main.wip:23:16 ]
    │
 23 │     val gone = bag
    │                ─┬─
    │                 ╰─── given here: `own<Bag>` is never copied
 24 │     apply((x) => bag.id + x, 2)     // captured after it was moved out
    │                  ─┬─
    │                   ╰─── used again here
    │
    │ Help: to keep `bag`, give a copy: `bag.clone()`
────╯
